{
 "_doc": [
  "The replay corpus: archived boards under examples/ and, per board, the pcb runs the bench makes with a chosen commit's",
  "tools. Each run writes one report that replay.py turns into lines (drc, check, regen, fab) and scores against labels.json.",
  "kind 'designer': the designer's own config (what an agent sees at hand-off). kind 'review': rows the reviewer added.",
  "verify_out: the file tools/verify_all.sh writes for the same run, so `replay.py --from-verify DIR` scores a verify run.",
  "Boards: 'pcb' is relative to dir; 'tar' unpacks a .tar.gz into the scratch dir first (Plink: the full project, 4 MB)."
 ],
